<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps cuts First Merchants debt.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps cuts First Merchants debt.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Monday it lowered the rating for First Merchants Acceptance Corp's $51.75 million of subordinated debt due 2006 to double-D from single-B.</p>
<p>The downgrade follows First Merchants' filing of a petition for protection under Chapter 11 of the Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
